+# Editorial review — Movement 005
+
+## Review status and coverage
+
+This is an informed editorial review, not a self-review, a fresh-context blind read, or a real human audience test. The thirteen-year-old and adult responses below are simulated reader lenses. Coverage is the complete supplied movement: chapters 30–37, eight chapters, 37,789 measured words. Canon evidence includes the edition brief, book map, state ledger through Movement 4, canon rules, universe bible, and Movement 005 packet.
